requirement:
Note that this is run via batch/cron.php via the command line only

To be able to run cron multiple times reset times:
UPDATE sysvars SET `value` = SUBDATE(NOW(), 1) WHERE `name` = 'last_cron' OR `name` = 'last_action_dates_cron';

Enable ffmpeg alternative files with the following example configs:
$ffmpeg_alternatives[0]["name"]="LowRes";
$ffmpeg_alternatives[0]["filename"]="LowRes";
$ffmpeg_alternatives[0]["extension"]="mp4";
$ffmpeg_alternatives[0]["params"]='-vf scale=120:-2 -vcodec libx264 -r 25 -b:a 400k -bt 480k -acodec aac -ac 2 -ab 160k -threads 0 -strict -2 -pix_fmt yuv420p';
$ffmpeg_alternatives[0]["lines_min"]=240;
$videojs_resolution_selection[0]["label"]="Original";
$videojs_resolution_selection[0]["name"]="";
$videojs_resolution_selection[1]["label"]="LowRes";
$videojs_resolution_selection[1]["name"]="LowRes";
